  <!-- EN: Hydrochloric Acid -->
  <MSHydrochloricAcid.label>盐酸</MSHydrochloricAcid.label>
  <!-- EN: Hydrochloric acid (or muriatic acid) is a colorless inorganic chemical with the formula H2O:HCl. Hydrochloric acid has a distinctive pungent smell. It is classified as strongly acidic and can attack the skin, since the hydrogen chloride completely dissociates in aqueous solution. Hydrochloric acid is the simplest chlorine-based acid system containing water. -->
  <MSHydrochloricAcid.description>盐酸（或称榈酸）是一种无色无机化学品，其化学式为 H2O:HCl。盐酸具有独特的刺激性气味。由于氯化氢在水溶液中会完全解离，因此盐酸被归类为强酸性，会腐蚀皮肤。盐酸是最简单的含水氯基酸体系。</MSHydrochloricAcid.description>
